(7310688, 1141158, 98565, '<td valign="top">this is such a wonderful clandestine shot! I''m not sure if I like it that the customers are sharp and the tradesman isn''t...but it''s certainly a lovely scene -7</td>', 'this is such a wonderful clandestine shot! I''m not sure if I like it that the customers are sharp and the tradesman isn''t...but it''s certainly a lovely scene -7', '2015-02-04 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310693, 1140754, 177322, '<td valign="top">The multiple frames - picture frame, outside bricks of window, window frame, pans on side of window, window and shelf in the back, high hanging pan at top  - all work remarkably well to bring the viewer''s attention to the baker in front. The has so many interesting things to explore. The light seems harsh washing out the colors a bit, but that is okay as it lends to the mood and, truth be known, there probably is not much color in a bakery kitchen anyway!  Double digit rating on this image from me.</td>', 'The multiple frames - picture frame, outside bricks of window, window frame, pans on side of window, window and shelf in the back, high hanging pan at top  - all work remarkably well to bring the viewer''s attention to the baker in front. The has so many interesting things to explore. The light seems harsh washing out the colors a bit, but that is okay as it lends to the mood and, truth be known, there probably is not much color in a bakery kitchen anyway!  Double digit rating on this image from me.', '2015-02-04 10:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310698, 1140985, 98565, '<td valign="top">remembers me of "Trick or Treat"-Time...<br/>Is "Putzfrau" a word that is regularly used in... wherever you come from (US, Australia, Canada...) I''m just curious</td>', 'remembers me of "Trick or Treat"-Time...Is "Putzfrau" a word that is regularly used in... wherever you come from (US, Australia, Canada...) I''m just curious', '2015-02-04 10:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310699, 1141129, 98565, '<td valign="top">and she is talking... I''ve never met a hairdresser who was working in silence...nice shot</td>', 'and she is talking... I''ve never met a hairdresser who was working in silence...nice shot', '2015-02-04 10:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310702, 1140579, 98565, '<td valign="top">great! This will be Top 5 for sure</td>', 'great! This will be Top 5 for sure', '2015-02-04 11:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310705, 1141107, 177322, '<td valign="top">A dying trade preserved:  the leading line of the bench, cluttered with tools of the trade and boots, encourages the eyes to circle round to the jolly craftsman himself. The sharpness of the image facilitated the opportunity to look at all the details of his shop - really quite fascinating. Two-digit score from me.</td>', 'A dying trade preserved:  the leading line of the bench, cluttered with tools of the trade and boots, encourages the eyes to circle round to the jolly craftsman himself. The sharpness of the image facilitated the opportunity to look at all the details of his shop - really quite fascinating. Two-digit score from me.', '2015-02-04 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310706, 1141192, 98565, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites in this challenge, this will ribbon, I''m sure<br/>Perfect look, perfect background blur, perfect colours from post-processing</td>', 'one of my favourites in this challenge, this will ribbon, I''m surePerfect look, perfect background blur, perfect colours from post-processing', '2015-02-04 11:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310710, 1141192, 177322, '<td valign="top">Compelling portrait; unfortunately there are no hints as to his vocation - a baker, based on the ball cap?  Maybe a curves adjustment would have darkened the image a tad to help emphasize his craggy face and the textures of his facial hair?  Still, it earns a ten from me.</td>', 'Compelling portrait; unfortunately there are no hints as to his vocation - a baker, based on the ball cap?  Maybe a curves adjustment would have darkened the image a tad to help emphasize his craggy face and the textures of his facial hair?  Still, it earns a ten from me.', '2015-02-04 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310714, 1140579, 177322, '<td valign="top">PoV extraordinaire! This earns a ten just for the fact you are at the peak of the roof with this fellow: it looks hazardous and cold.  Still your focus is spot on; composition is very effective.  You efforts to get his shot and execute it technically must be lauded.  Ten from me.</td>', 'PoV extraordinaire! This earns a ten just for the fact you are at the peak of the roof with this fellow: it looks hazardous and cold.  Still your focus is spot on; composition is very effective.  You efforts to get his shot and execute it technically must be lauded.  Ten from me.', '2015-02-04 11:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310720, 1141184, 177322, '<td valign="top">Great tones.  Unique occupation to capture. Fun capture of the blend of new technology alongside the bell.  Like the refection of the water in the window.  Just wish we could have seen a little more of the operator.</td>', 'Great tones.  Unique occupation to capture. Fun capture of the blend of new technology alongside the bell.  Like the refection of the water in the window.  Just wish we could have seen a little more of the operator.', '2015-02-04 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310726, 1141092, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2015-02-04 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310727, 1141192, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2</td>', 'Top 2', '2015-02-04 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310854, 1141088, 177322, '<td valign="top">Perfect interpretation for this challenge. B&amp;W was an excellent choice.  In most of the other images, I have appreciated the ability to view all the background "stuff" defining the particular trade.  Had this been mine - and, of course, it is not, so this represents a personal preference - I think I would have cropped either side to the pillars and down to the top of the light well on the rear of the bed. The rich B&amp;W tonality would still be there but the focus would be more on the mechanic.  Still very much appreciate this picture, though and will gladly give it a two digit rating.  Good luck.</td>', 'Perfect interpretation for this challenge. B&W was an excellent choice.  In most of the other images, I have appreciated the ability to view all the background "stuff" defining the particular trade.  Had this been mine - and, of course, it is not, so this represents a personal preference - I think I would have cropped either side to the pillars and down to the top of the light well on the rear of the bed. The rich B&W tonality would still be there but the focus would be more on the mechanic.  Still very much appreciate this picture, though and will gladly give it a two digit rating.  Good luck.', '2015-02-04 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310856, 1140697, 177322, '<td valign="top">Gritty. Shiny. Colorful. Well lit. I like the way the reflection leads to the task at hand. Oh, and muscular, too.  Ah-hem, yes. Anyway, effective entry for this challenge.  Ten from me.</td>', 'Gritty. Shiny. Colorful. Well lit. I like the way the reflection leads to the task at hand. Oh, and muscular, too.  Ah-hem, yes. Anyway, effective entry for this challenge.  Ten from me.', '2015-02-04 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310858, 1141197, 177322, '<td valign="top">Although I am not "into" bikes, this scene is a suitable choice for this challenge and interesting enough that I am curious about what he is doing. Nicely framed. Good focus.</td>', 'Although I am not "into" bikes, this scene is a suitable choice for this challenge and interesting enough that I am curious about what he is doing. Nicely framed. Good focus.', '2015-02-04 15:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310859, 1141160, 177322, '<td valign="top">Clearly a fellow who works hard and efficiently at his tasks. B&amp;W was a good choice. Are those his bare toes peeking out of his footwear? Engaging image - good luck.</td>', 'Clearly a fellow who works hard and efficiently at his tasks. B&W was a good choice. Are those his bare toes peeking out of his footwear? Engaging image - good luck.', '2015-02-04 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310863, 1141146, 177322, '<td valign="top">An unusual vocation to capture in a unique PoV, but one I think most of us can identify with when that dang paper jams.  Well done.</td>', 'An unusual vocation to capture in a unique PoV, but one I think most of us can identify with when that dang paper jams.  Well done.', '2015-02-04 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310864, 1140573, 177322, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  Your choice of B&amp;W gets away from the sometimes trite blue arc and encourages the eye to circle the image instead of focusing on the it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well composed.  Your choice of B&W gets away from the sometimes trite blue arc and encourages the eye to circle the image instead of focusing on the it.  Good luck.', '2015-02-04 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
