(7315926, 1141092, 176839, '<td valign="top">WOW thanks everyone. This is my mate 85 years young Keith. He is one of the best armature winder  and balancer in Australia.<br/>Keith Used to have a very successful business and sold it many years ago when he retired from business. The current owners still get him in to balance armatures when they have trouble with any of their jobs. BTW he was also my model for the Jack and Jill photo on a sad note my wife <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34114" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">naomik</a> and self lost our  little fur daughter (Jack Russell) of 18 years to old age last week.  The pain is unbearable but we know that she is now in the arms of Jesus.<br/> <br/>God Bless you all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-02-11 02:16:49.</i></td>', 'WOW thanks everyone. This is my mate 85 years young Keith. He is one of the best armature winder  and balancer in Australia.Keith Used to have a very successful business and sold it many years ago when he retired from business. The current owners still get him in to balance armatures when they have trouble with any of their jobs. BTW he was also my model for the Jack and Jill photo on a sad note my wife  naomik and self lost our  little fur daughter (Jack Russell) of 18 years to old age last week.  The pain is unbearable but we know that she is now in the arms of Jesus. God Bless you all.', '2015-02-11 02:05:23.000000', '2015-02-11 02:16:49.000000', 0),
