(7316168, 1141129, 108991, '<td valign="top">I completely agree with jomari. Interesting though, since the other participants finished almost exactly in the order of my ofn preference - never seen such a close match before!<br/>I guess the left hand kept other people from better appreciation. It is a bit disturbing indeed, but the left part of the photo more than makes up for it. Photography is art, not something done by the rule book.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-02-12 04:36:37.</i></td>', 'I completely agree with jomari. Interesting though, since the other participants finished almost exactly in the order of my ofn preference - never seen such a close match before!I guess the left hand kept other people from better appreciation. It is a bit disturbing indeed, but the left part of the photo more than makes up for it. Photography is art, not something done by the rule book.', '2015-02-12 04:32:40.000000', '2015-02-12 04:36:37.000000', 0),
(7316170, 1141092, 6519, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Deve:</b></div><hr/><i>God Bless you all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Except ME...... I was the only one that dared express something other than glowing praise, hence mine was the only comment not marked by you as "helpful".<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong..... there is much to like about this photograph, which is the very reason why I even bothered to comment. It is gorgeous.... I just felt (and still feel) it would be better if it showed me what I am sooooo dying to see!!!<br/> <br/>I do find it a little sad, though..... just because I didn''t call you a GOD, that doesn''t necessarily mean my comment should be the only useless one. <br/> <br/>Isn''t there a chance that even negative, constructive critism could be useful to you in some way? Doesn''t it still tell you something about how your image connected with some people? Could you honestly not find something "helpful" in such a comment?<br/> <br/>This is the very reason I so rarely bother to comment these days...... I just don''t believe in gushing praise when I feel I could, instead, add something remotely useful. And yet, unless you call somebody "God''s gift to photography", a comment is rarely welcomed.<br/> <br/>All the best to you, though.... your photo is mostly very lovely!</td>', 'Originally posted by Deve:God Bless you all.  Except ME...... I was the only one that dared express something other than glowing praise, hence mine was the only comment not marked by you as "helpful". Don''t get me wrong..... there is much to like about this photograph, which is the very reason why I even bothered to comment. It is gorgeous.... I just felt (and still feel) it would be better if it showed me what I am sooooo dying to see!!! I do find it a little sad, though..... just because I didn''t call you a GOD, that doesn''t necessarily mean my comment should be the only useless one.  Isn''t there a chance that even negative, constructive critism could be useful to you in some way? Doesn''t it still tell you something about how your image connected with some people? Could you honestly not find something "helpful" in such a comment? This is the very reason I so rarely bother to comment these days...... I just don''t believe in gushing praise when I feel I could, instead, add something remotely useful. And yet, unless you call somebody "God''s gift to photography", a comment is rarely welcomed. All the best to you, though.... your photo is mostly very lovely!', '2015-02-12 05:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7316184, 1141092, 176839, '<td valign="top">Wow.....some here take themselves wayyyyyyy to seriously....I am not into this sort of forum crap....just want to share some photos when I have the time from my photography business. I am not interested in  long posts back and forth,  because one wants to prove their  point,  or feel that their comment was not marked as helpful. I just want to look at others photos and share some if mine,  NOT INTERESTED IN THE DRAMA!!!!!!<br/> <br/>And God bless you all.....even the ones who''s comments I deem as not helpfull to  me to further my career as a professional photographer. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow.....some here take themselves wayyyyyyy to seriously....I am not into this sort of forum crap....just want to share some photos when I have the time from my photography business. I am not interested in  long posts back and forth,  because one wants to prove their  point,  or feel that their comment was not marked as helpful. I just want to look at others photos and share some if mine,  NOT INTERESTED IN THE DRAMA!!!!!! And God bless you all.....even the ones who''s comments I deem as not helpfull to  me to further my career as a professional photographer.  ', '2015-02-12 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
