(7316209, 1140568, 138253, '<td valign="top">For those wondering, the gator is no longer living, and has been turned into a statue. I took another picture with my son''s hand in the gator''s mouth, "feeding" it a rock, but it was pretty blurry due to the speed with which he got away from the gator. And yes, this is very much a shoehorn, I titled it in a way that some should pick up on that :)<br/> <br/>for a laugh, I showed this image to my mother-in-law immediately upon our return, I think I almost gave her a heart attack.</td>', 'For those wondering, the gator is no longer living, and has been turned into a statue. I took another picture with my son''s hand in the gator''s mouth, "feeding" it a rock, but it was pretty blurry due to the speed with which he got away from the gator. And yes, this is very much a shoehorn, I titled it in a way that some should pick up on that :) for a laugh, I showed this image to my mother-in-law immediately upon our return, I think I almost gave her a heart attack.', '2015-02-12 09:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
